{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Have you ever wondered what it would be like to become an Intercontinental Ballistic Missile?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRAINSHELL is a psychological horror experience focusing on immersion and storytelling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/1ea2d7ee02b5a9e8e747d1099374bb2a.avif?t=1758789081\" width=852 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game will immerse you into a story that twists the fragile human mind with propaganda and horrors of brainwashing.</strong> As your first and final mission begins, memories of brutal training resurface. You will dance on the edge of insanity while piloting humanity\u2019s doom, and descend into surreal visions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IGNORE THE HALLUCINATIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/f736d1683c44a1c4f9ed546d9c8412cd.poster.avif?t=1758789081\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/f736d1683c44a1c4f9ed546d9c8412cd.webm?t=1758789081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/f736d1683c44a1c4f9ed546d9c8412cd.mp4?t=1758789081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will operate control panels inspired by the Cold War era to guide the man made monstrosity as you piece together the twisted history of a world that replaced computers with human brains.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REMEMBER THE TRAINING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/cdc7b1f87e2537d4b85663f5cd94eb0f.poster.avif?t=1758789081\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/cdc7b1f87e2537d4b85663f5cd94eb0f.webm?t=1758789081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/cdc7b1f87e2537d4b85663f5cd94eb0f.mp4?t=1758789081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end is inevitable. There is no escape from the metal shell that cages you. You are the weapon, and the weapon must be used.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE OUR NATION'S HOPE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/20b7f58192b59e6a574cddeea932a7a7.poster.avif?t=1758789081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/20b7f58192b59e6a574cddeea932a7a7.webm?t=1758789081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/extras/20b7f58192b59e6a574cddeea932a7a7.mp4?t=1758789081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3206220?t=1758789081","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/b543a0b157f27cd27b2486218f7490e1a6698744/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758789081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206220/e013e27f07e84ac0d36a1b1dc035e685e66a37ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758789081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.